import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 367 | Dou Continent · Realm-Inflation Critique: The Setting Collapse of Twenty Realms","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 367 | Dou Continent · Realm-Inflation Critique: The Setting Collapse of Twenty Realms","no":367,"module":2,"tags":["Dou Continent","Realm Inflation","Twenty Realms","Setting Collapse","Combat-Power Inflation"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table","90-Glossary"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0367_模块2-斗罗-境界膨胀批判-二十层境界的设定崩坏.md","filePath":"en/0367_模块2-斗罗-境界膨胀批判-二十层境界的设定崩坏.md"}'),o={name:"en/0367_模块2-斗罗-境界膨胀批判-二十层境界的设定崩坏.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,u,d){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-367-dou-continent-·-realm-inflation-critique-the-setting-collapse-of-twenty-realms" tabindex="-1">Entry 367 | Dou Continent · Realm-Inflation Critique: The Setting Collapse of Twenty Realms <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-367-dou-continent-·-realm-inflation-critique-the-setting-collapse-of-twenty-realms" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 367 | Dou Continent · Realm-Inflation Critique: The Setting Collapse of Twenty Realms&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dou Continent System Decomposition (Entry 8) | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 97, 90</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-title-douluo-is-no-longer-the-peak" tabindex="-1">Introduction: When &quot;Title Douluo&quot; is no longer the peak <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-title-douluo-is-no-longer-the-peak" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: When &quot;Title Douluo&quot; is no longer the peak&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The law-first axiom requires setting self-consistency over plot convenience. Dou Continent&#39;s realm inflation is the most textbook case in web-literature history: at the opening &quot;Soul Masters are already respected, Great Soul Masters are already elite,&quot; readers thought Title Douluo was the ceiling; little did they know there were still Super Douluo, Extreme Douluo, Half-God, Priest, Third-God, Second-God, First-God, God-King — all the way to twenty layers. The numerical ladder carefully erected early is hollowed out by floors added layer by layer late. This entry, taking the law-first axiom as core, critiques this inflation. Protagonist uniqueness dependency: <strong>high (gift-style leaning oligarchic)</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Numerical inflation</strong>: every added realm layer devalues early numbers; readers&#39; hard-won &quot;strong-weak intuition&quot; is voided again and again</li><li><strong>Comparison failure</strong>: late &quot;God-King casually creates worlds&quot; and early &quot;Title Douluo is already legend&quot; cannot be measured on the same ruler</li><li><strong>Layer redundancy</strong>: among twenty layers many adjacent tiers have vague strength gaps; set but unused, used but undifferentiated</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Authority dilution</strong>: the more realms, the lower each tier&#39;s scarcity; the distance of &quot;effort-attainable&quot; infinitely lengthened</li><li><strong>Goal spinning empty</strong>: commoner cultivators can never catch the continually raised ceiling; cultivation becomes a toil with no visible endpoint</li><li><strong>Setting cost</strong>: to maintain twenty-layer self-consistency, the author must keep patching, ending full of holes</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Layers as resources</strong>: every added realm layer is set &quot;so the protagonist can keep leveling&quot;; all beings are only background for new floors</li><li><strong>Ceiling bending to the protagonist</strong>: when Tang San reaches Title Douluo, the worldview temporarily adds floors — rules are not constants, but functions of the protagonist&#39;s height</li><li><strong>Oppression inflation</strong>: to manufacture new enemies, old enemies are batch-demoted; early rivals late become mooks</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dou Twenty-Layer Inflation</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Twenty layers from Soul Apprentice to God-King</td><td>Nine realms (Sense Origin to Origin) + two realms (Multiverse, Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse) stable framework</td></tr><tr><td>Layers added by plot</td><td>Law precedes, legislate first then expand, appendix-caliber incremental join</td></tr><tr><td>Adjacent tiers vague</td><td>Each realm&#39;s breakthrough standard, cost, exam clear and checkable</td></tr><tr><td>Add wherever protagonist goes</td><td>Plane Transcendent four-dimensional exam, not shifting with protagonist&#39;s needs</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The alternative&#39;s crux: Heng Yuan Zhou uses the fixed &quot;nine-plus-two&quot; framework to structurally prevent &quot;adding floors for the protagonist.&quot;</p><p>What replaces twenty-layer inflation is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s stable &quot;nine-plus-two&quot; framework. The reason Path D · human-engineered Dao-Law soul rings can fit into this framework is precisely that it anchors breakthrough standards to Dao-Law accumulation, not raises floors with the protagonist&#39;s height. Lin Hao self-proves within the fixed framework, never privately adding layers — realms are no longer the plot&#39;s ladder, but law&#39;s steps; commoners can see the endpoint, and geniuses cannot overrun the law.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate the Dou twenty realms&#39; strength spacing and inflation rate</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A twenty-layer inflation; Group B nine-plus-two stable framework</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: reader credibility (numerical self-consistency), commoners&#39; highest attainable tier</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output &quot;Setting-Credit Decay Curve Caused by Realm Inflation&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: low</strong>. Twenty-layer late-tier strength relations chaotic; the higher, the vaguer</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: extreme</strong>. The realm system itself is a retcon disaster area; sequels add divine ranks</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high</strong></li></ul><p>The problem with twenty realms is not that there are many, but that every added layer dilutes the previous layer&#39;s scarcity. When &quot;Title Douluo&quot; changes from legend to starting point, readers&#39; intuition for numbers is voided again and again. Realm inflation to the end means &quot;who is strong&quot; is no longer answered by setting, but by plot — this is setting surrendering to plot.</p><p>Realm inflation also has a hidden cost: readers&#39; emotional investment is diluted. Early the protagonist risks life to break through one realm, readers thrilled; late he casually breaks through ten realms, that thrill numbs. When leveling is no longer rare, hot-blood fails. Late Dou readers are harder and harder to move by new realms; essentially numerical inflation has overdrawn emotional currency — this is realm inflation&#39;s cost at the narrative level.</p><p>Realm inflation also forms a vicious cycle with &quot;villain upgrade.&quot; The protagonist must be stronger, so the villain must be stronger; the villain must be stronger, so the worldview must add new floors. Thus from Title Douluo to God-King, villains&#39; realms rise with the tide, the protagonist&#39;s tier follows infinitely upward. This arms-race-style setting expansion has no internal brake at all, relying entirely on the author&#39;s manual braking. The reason Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s nine-plus-two is stable is precisely that it stipulates the brake&#39;s position from the start — no matter how strong the protagonist and villains, they cannot run out of the floors the law delineates.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: numerical inflation devalues early accumulated setting credit</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: ceiling bends to protagonist; all beings reduced to backdrop</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo caps at Fierce Realm with restrained layers; Dou extends life by adding layers, going to the other extreme</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the higher the realm, the farther from all beings; the twenty-layer peak is a lone ruler</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: a system maintained by adding layers cannot infinitely expand without collapse</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Twenty realms are not grand, but out of control. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer: a good realm system does not depend on many layers, but on each layer standing firm. Nine-plus-two, few and stable, wins over many and chaotic.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dou Continent · realm-inflation critique · setting collapse of twenty realms described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./368_模块2-斗罗-吃书烂尾深度分析-后期设定推翻前期.html">Entry 368 · Retcon-Ending Deep Analysis</a> · <a href="./381_模块2-斗罗-境界体系替代-九境加二境的稳定框架.html">Entry 381 · Realm-System Alternative</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const m=t(o,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
